   <media:description>Student firefighter Tsunami shares her experience volunteering to serve her community. She is one of several Penn Staters who serve at the Alpha Fire Company station near the University Park campus in State College, Pennsylvania. Many of their calls involve members of the Penn State community and often impact familiar places or people. 

